# SHELVED 2026-08-29, out of the build. A design sketch in pre-current syntax that nothing loads; the types it
# names were never declared (the unknown-type warning counts them). Delete `note draft` to bring it back.
note draft

# IO effect ADT for the HVM backend. Maps to IO_Done, IO_Call, IO_bind protocol.

form effect
  head result
  case done
    link value, like result
  case call
    link name, like text
    link argument, like text
    link next
      like task
        take result, like text
        send back
          like effect
            fuse result, read result
  case bind
    head middle
    link action
      like effect
        fuse result, read middle
    link next
      like task
        take value, like middle
        send back
          like effect
            fuse result, read result